Subject: [PATCH 4/7] docs, packaging, maths: reconcile status, repair Prop.
 5.2's remainder, fix the package include list

- Prop. 5.2's remainder was stated as O(eps^2 lambda_1/delta); the appendix
  proof's own expression is O(||M||^2/delta^2) = O(eps^2 lambda_1^2/delta^2), and
  the stated order is violated as soon as lambda_1/delta > 1.  Repaired in
  05_linear_ae.tex, mlst/03_theory.tex and appE_symmetry_geometry.tex, with the
  violation exhibited on a coupling-block perturbation in check_revision_claims.py.
  Prop. 6.3 checked in full (identity, signs, Ky Fan partial-trace cap, the
  Delta_k lower bound) and is correct; both propositions are now machine-checked.
- Canonical plan section 8 exit tiers restated against the three rejected models,
  with the cause of each change recorded rather than the bar silently moving:
  c_F/c_U -> the measured x_F/x_U; N* 'located or bracketed'; the T21 handoff
  curve is not monotone and no abstention threshold exists.  Section 11 gate boxes
  updated.  Tier reached: strong, on the amended wording.
- plan/README, MLST_EXPERIMENT_PROGRAMME, TODO, OPEN_ISSUES and CHANGELOG brought
  current; superseded paragraphs marked historical; provenance gaps G1 and G2
  recorded separately from file integrity.
- package_arxiv.py: the five generated Part II figures were referenced by
  07_experiments.tex but absent from the include list -- a real packaging defect,
  now fixed (36 files, 'missing: none').  The MLST entry points and mlst/ are
  excluded always.  Gate still HELD; no package written.
- SUBMISSION.md documents all three builds, the deliberate layout difference, the
  build order the supplement's xr import needs, and the exporters/recomputation.
- mlst/gated_aliases.tex resolves the shared gated block's labels in the private
  preview; all three gated builds now have 0 undefined references.

