+contribution is absent (−3.8e−05 [−2.3e−04, +1.3e−04], p = 0.70) because inside a
+nine-bin band the noise PSD is nearly flat. Four amendments A1–A4 recorded with
+their causes; A4 was made on development material before any hold-out outcome was
+read, and development was re-scored once with identical contrasts.
+`scripts/recompute_t22.py` re-derives every interval, p-value and verdict from the
+archived draw arrays and reproduces them exactly.
